{"hz":40,"calls":[{"id":"boiler","biz":"Larchfield Heating","place":"Heating engineer · Leeds","initial":"L","c":"#2563EB","ink":"#FFFFFF","clock":"23:10","owner":"Dan","caller":"Sam Whitfield","from":"07700 900418","scene":"Dan clocked off at 17:30. The phone rings at 23:10.","outcome":"Job booked","src":"boiler/call.mp3?v=32c7ea11","len":67.06,"ring":[0.3,1.8],"env":"","lines":[{"who":"agent","text":"Larchfield Heating, you’re through to Dan’s AI assistant. He’s finished for the night, but I can sort most things. What’s happened?","t":2.11,"d":7.13,"w":[0.02,0.58,1.4,1.58,1.86,2,2.38,2.74,3.76,3.96,4.22,4.34,4.44,4.84,5.18,5.26,5.42,5.66,5.9,6.66,6.84],"acts":[[0,"Answered on the first ring, and said it is an AI","ok"]]},{"who":"caller","text":"Oh, hiya. Sorry, I know it’s late. The boiler’s just gone off, there’s a code on it, F28, and we’ve got no hot water at all.","t":9.6,"d":10.47,"w":[0.02,0.52,1.62,2.22,2.34,2.5,2.74,4.44,4.6,5,5.2,5.38,5.82,5.98,6.12,6.4,6.54,7.04,8.7,8.8,8.94,9.18,9.4,9.62,9.94,10.18],"acts":[]},{"who":"agent","text":"Oh, that’s no fun at this time of night. Before anything else, can you smell gas anywhere?","t":20.62,"d":5.73,"w":[0.02,0.64,0.9,1.22,1.38,1.52,1.74,1.96,2.12,3.04,3.42,3.8,4.4,4.6,4.8,5.12,5.44],"acts":[[0.45,"Dan’s rule: ask about gas before anything else","rule"]]},{"who":"caller","text":"No. No, nothing like that.","t":26.65,"d":2.47,"w":[0.02,0.9,1.56,1.92,2.18],"acts":[]},{"who":"agent","text":"Good. And is anything leaking, or is it dry underneath?","t":29.52,"d":3.91,"w":[0.02,0.76,1.22,1.38,1.84,2.68,2.96,3.08,3.26,3.62],"acts":[[0,"No gas smell, so a visit is safe to book","ok"]]},{"who":"caller","text":"Dry, yeah. The pressure’s on about one and a half, if that helps.","t":33.79,"d":4.85,"w":[0.02,0.72,1.46,1.58,2,2.14,3.22,3.34,3.46,3.58,4.3,4.42,4.56],"acts":[]},{"who":"agent","text":"It does, that tells Dan what to bring. He’s free tomorrow at eight. A breakdown visit starts at £95. Shall I put you in?","t":39